# Testing

- xUnit + Moq + FluentAssertions. No Testcontainers / WebApplicationFactory in this repo.
- Mirror features: `*ValidatorTests`, `*CommandHandlerTests`, `*QueryHandlerTests`.
- Mock Application abstractions; do not spin real Postgres/RabbitMQ in unit tests.
- EF InMemory only if an existing test in that project already does.
- Run the service `*.Tests` project after changes. User Application has Coverlet line threshold 90.
- There is no integration-test host yet — do not invent one unless asked.
- Details: [docs/ai/testing.md](../../docs/ai/testing.md).
